      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would also discourage some people from getting a client. I have friends that started using cliants specifically because of a mod that allows you to have unlimited favorites, only to later to get corrupted by the more \"sketchy\" features of the cliants and start causing trouble. Admittedly, this wouldn't make a huge difference, but I know at least five cliants users that only obtained the cliants to get more favorites, only to later become toxic cliants users.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
