        "like": 5
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The entire point is that you go visit the avatar worlds more often. For creators you're ruining the point of their world. Why bother making a nice world if people join once, favorite all their stuff, and never return?\nEvery person who makes this suggestion of more avatar favorites in any way, is always a person who doesn't upload their own stuff and don't care about the people who DO upload stuff for others to use.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-01-10T15:29:40.004Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Avatar favorites should not only have a higher number (say 25-35) but I feel that there should also be an option to have a 'collection' for your saved avatars. this way you can collect many more avatars without having to be picky on what you favorite. maybe you want a few dozen avatars from one world, but don't want to favorite them all for fear of running out of space.\nHaving an 'avatar collection' much like you can collect worlds would be a nice feature.",
